{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/856", "id": 534208900, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTM0MjA4OTAw", "html_url": "https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/pull/856", "diff_url": "https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/pull/856.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/pull/856.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/issues/856", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/856/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/856/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/issues/856/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/statuses/41083190acb8d5ee6fff1b0977f96fef3eac9b0d", "number": 856, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fixed flaky tests caused by SharedMetricRegistries in SharedMetricRegistriesTest.java", "user": {"login": "KellyShao", "id": 24410016, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDEwMDE2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24410016?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao", "html_url": "https://github.com/KellyShao", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Fixed flaky test that caused by `io.dropwizard.metrics.SharedMetricRegistries` in class `SharedMetricRegistriesTest.java`. \r\n\r\n- **Issue 1** \r\n    - If only run `errorsWhenDefaultAlreadySet()` method before `hasASetOfNames()`method, the `hasASetOfNames()` will failed at https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/blob/fcded1683dcbd41a968e221494778aa6b71e7428/metrics/src/test/java/io/dropwizard/metrics/SharedMetricRegistriesTest.java#L45\r\n\r\n    - error msg: \r\n    ```\r\n        java.lang.AssertionError: \r\n        Expecting:\r\n          <[\"one\", \"borg\", \"foobah\"]>\r\n        to contain only:\r\n          <[\"one\"]>\r\n        but the following elements were unexpected:\r\n          <[\"borg\", \"foobah\"]>\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n- **Issue 2** \r\n    - If only run `errorsWhenDefaultAlreadySet()` method before `removesRegistries()`method, the `removesRegistries()` will failed at https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/blob/fcded1683dcbd41a968e221494778aa6b71e7428/metrics/src/test/java/io/dropwizard/metrics/SharedMetricRegistriesTest.java#L54\r\n\r\n    - error msg: \r\n    ```\r\n       java.lang.AssertionError: \r\n       Expecting:\r\n         <[\"one\", \"foobah\"]>\r\n       to contain only:\r\n         <[\"one\"]>\r\n       but the following elements were unexpected:\r\n         <[\"foobah\"]>\r\n    ```\r\n- **root cause**\r\n    - The `SharedMetricRegistries` variable is not cleared after each tests. \r\n\r\n- **solution**: \r\nAdded `setUp()` and `tearDown()` methods right before and after each tests to clear `SharedMetricRegistries`.\r\n\r\nThe flaky tests are found by running [iDFlakies](https://github.com/idflakies/iDFlakies), after fixing the issue, there's no flaky tests in `SharedMetricRegistriesTest.java`", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2020-12-08T07:37:48Z", "updated_at": "2020-12-09T16:45:52Z", "closed_at": "2020-12-09T16:37:35Z", "merged_at": "2020-12-09